# 🗂 Terraform Backend

Remote state storage is configured using Amazon S3.

## Benefits

- Centralized state management
- Team collaboration
- State persistence
- Improved reliability

### Backend

```hcl
backend "s3" {
    bucket = "<terraform-state-bucket>"
}
```

