---

# 💼 Resume Highlights

- Provisioned a production-grade Amazon EKS cluster using Terraform across multiple Availability Zones.
- Designed and implemented custom VPC networking with public/private subnets, NAT Gateway, route tables, and security groups.
- Configured managed node groups using both On-Demand and Spot instances to optimize reliability and infrastructure costs.
- Implemented remote Terraform state management using Amazon S3.
- Integrated Kubernetes workloads with AWS Load Balancer Controller and verified end-to-end traffic routing.
- Prepared the Kubernetes platform for GitOps deployment using ArgoCD and observability using Prometheus and Grafana.

